    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Per-component value override for one of the workflow asset&apos;s declared variables (Material-Instance pattern: the asset owns the declaration — name and type — the component may only override the initial value). Name and Value.Type must match a variable declared on the asset; non-matching (stale) overrides are skipped with a warning at agent-creation time. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
